<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>Desafio 1 | Scrum Dungeon</title>

    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/main.css" />
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/desafio1.css" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/assets/img/favicon.ico" />
  </head>

  <body class="pagina-desafio1">
    <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <main class="desafio1-main">
      <section class="desafio1-wrapper">
        <header class="desafio1-title reveal-step step-1">
          <div class="title-box">
            <span>Entrada da arena</span>
            <h1 id="chapterTitle">Cap&iacute;tulo 1: Boss Fight</h1>
          </div>
        </header>

        <section class="boss-intro-card">
          <div class="boss-briefing reveal-step step-3">
            <span class="boss-kicker">Briefing do confronto</span>

            <div class="boss-type-box">
              <h3 id="bossName"></h3>
              <p id="bossTypeText"></p>
            </div>

            <section class="rules-card reveal-step step-5">
              <button class="rules-toggle" id="btnToggleRegras" type="button">
                Regras do confronto
              </button>

              <div class="rules-content" id="rulesContent">
                <ul>
                  <li>Voc&ecirc; enfrentar&aacute; 10 quest&otilde;es.</li>
                  <li>O desafio ter&aacute; tempo limite de 20 minutos.</li>
                  <li>
                    Ao sair antes do fim, o desafio poder&aacute; ser reiniciado
                    futuramente.
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    Quando o tempo acabar, quest&otilde;es n&atilde;o respondidas
                    contar&atilde;o como erradas.
                  </li>
                  <li>Voc&ecirc; possui 2 tentativas para derrotar este boss.</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </section>
          </div>

          <div class="boss-image-frame reveal-step step-2">
            <img
              id="bossImage"
              src="/assets/img/capitulo_1/inimigos/confronto-1.png"
              alt="Boss do desafio"
              class="boss-scene-img"
            />
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="boss-actions reveal-step step-4">
          <button id="btnIniciarDesafio" class="btn-boss-start" type="button">
            Iniciar desafio
          </button>

          <button id="btnVoltarMapa" class="btn-boss-secondary" type="button">
            Voltar ao mapa
          </button>

          <div class="boss-lives-box">
            <span class="boss-lives-label">Vidas da run</span>
            <div
              id="vidasDesafio"
              class="boss-lives-icons vidas-container"
            ></div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </section>
    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
    <script src="/assets/js/audio.js"></script>
    <script src="/assets/js/main.js"></script>
    <script src="/assets/js/desafio1.js"></script>
  </body>
</html>
